{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://hk.on.cc/hk/bkn/cnt/news/20261029/photo/bkn-20261029140710957-1029_00822_001_01p.jpg?20261029150926\"/><p>案發在紫荊園。（張開裕攝）</p><p>赤柱發生巨額盜竊。今午(29日)1時09分，舂磡角道42號紫荊園一獨立屋，女戶主發現屋內2件總值約1000萬美元(折算約7800萬港元)的珠寶不翼而飛，懷疑被賊人偷去，遂報案求助。警員到場調查後，列作「盜竊」案跟進，正設法追緝賊人下落。據了解，戶主外遊後返港，發現2件珠寶不見了，懷疑是家傭所為。</p><p>on.cc東網</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-29T07:22:17.303730+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":170,"images":1,"source":"東網 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-29T06:07:10+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-29T07:18:39.805920+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-29T07:18:39.805920+00:00","content_hash":"11b4e00250af49ffcfa857bf420b526e5fd645241f76a65dba7e7d5f6486d001","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}